Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.55,0:00:16.32,Default,T,0,0,0,,Giant lizards!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.47,Default,T,0,0,0,,Komodo dragons.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.13,0:00:21.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,Take her to the other side of the river.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.82,0:00:23.45,Default,T,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll get the BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.99,0:00:26.06,Default,T,0,0,0,,You'll what?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.65,0:00:28.36,Default,T,0,0,0,,That's crazy, Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.17,0:00:32.77,Default,T,0,0,0,,Hey, hang in there.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.70,0:00:44.20,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, get back here!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.33,0:00:54.30,Default,T,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.30,0:00:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't exploding!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.81,0:00:57.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.95,0:01:02.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}The switch...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.29,0:01:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}isn't working!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.51,0:01:07.42,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I took these BIMs from that kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.11,0:01:08.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe they...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.83,0:01:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,don't count as {\i0\i1}my{\i1} BIMs because I didn't kill him or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.07,0:01:18.41,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.15,0:01:20.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.45,0:01:24.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which ones are mine?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}N-Not these, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.16,0:01:28.91,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.83,0:01:32.11,Default,T,0,0,0,,Stay back, damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.11,0:01:33.54,Default,T,0,0,0,,Lay off us!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,M-Mr. Taira!
