Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.85,Default,T,0,0,0,,This is a disaster.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.40,0:03:41.53,Default,T,0,0,0,,My right leg again...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.34,0:03:46.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You're having to carry everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.29,Default,T,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.29,0:03:50.61,Default,T,0,0,0,,We fit everything in one trunk.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.61,0:03:53.47,Default,T,0,0,0,,And you have it worse.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.47,0:03:55.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}you{\i0} do.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.93,0:03:57.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,We need to stop the bleeding on that leg.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.12,0:04:00.59,Default,T,0,0,0,,We don't have time.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.59,0:04:04.43,Default,T,0,0,0,,More importantly, be sure you \Nkeep that girl on your back.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.96,0:04:05.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.34,0:04:09.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're following us.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.76,0:04:20.19,Default,T,0,0,0,,But y'know, Sakamato...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.19,0:04:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare to find a guy as good as you these days.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm really nothing special.{That isn't true.}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.98,0:04:28.83,Default,T,0,0,0,,Why didn't you run and leave us behind?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.83,0:04:30.27,Default,T,0,0,0,,From your perspective,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.27,0:04:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we're just an old guy and an unconscious girl you don't even know, slowing you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.96,0:04:40.29,Default,T,0,0,0,,In that situation, no one would blame you if you'd left us to die.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.52,0:04:46.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira... Why are you always saying things like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.26,0:04:52.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,Are you... testing me?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.82,0:04:54.89,Default,T,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.89,0:04:56.29,Default,T,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.81,Default,T,0,0,0,,But I'm scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.88,0:05:03.36,Default,T,0,0,0,,When you left to go fight,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.00,0:05:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered if maybe you wouldn't come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.16,0:05:10.43,Default,T,0,0,0,,If you had abandoned me...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.02,0:05:15.87,Default,T,0,0,0,,It was all I could think about.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.52,0:05:20.63,Default,T,0,0,0,,I couldn't help it. I was seriously terrified. {TLC} { Come on, 'Shouganai' is like the weaboos' most favorite japanese phrase }
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.34,0:05:24.40,Default,T,0,0,0,,What we talked about afterwards...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.40,0:05:29.26,Default,T,0,0,0,,When that girl said someone wanted to get rid of us...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.78,0:05:34.89,Default,T,0,0,0,,I can't help but think that maybe she's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.00,0:05:39.63,Default,T,0,0,0,,I was kind to my family,{Keep consistent with preview from ep. 05}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.63,0:05:41.45,Default,T,0,0,0,,but I was a monster at work.{Keep consistent with preview from ep. 05}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.38,0:05:45.43,Default,T,0,0,0,,I took advantage of loopholes and gray areas in the law.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.60,0:05:50.03,Default,T,0,0,0,,It wouldn't surprise me if any of them hated me.{Keep consistent with preview from ep. 05}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.98,0:05:53.16,Default,T,0,0,0,,This is karma.{Keep consistent with preview from ep. 05}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.10,0:05:58.54,Default,T,0,0,0,,Anything you do wrong will come \Nback to get you in the end.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.88,0:06:02.47,Default,T,0,0,0,,Yes. This is my punishment.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.90,0:06:04.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.54,0:06:08.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,I... won't betray you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.43,0:06:12.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,Th-They're close!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.81,Default,T,0,0,0,,Run! Run for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.81,0:06:16.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey... Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.35,0:06:18.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,Taira!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.12,0:06:22.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.58,0:06:32.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.84,0:06:35.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.30,0:06:39.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,Where did you go, Mr. Taira?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.65,0:06:40.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.06,0:06:54.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}We got separated?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, that isn't right.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.67,0:07:00.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can't detect him using radar, that means he isn't moving.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.86,0:07:03.55,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why wouldn't he move at a time like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.86,0:07:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In a situation like this, no one would \Nblame you if you'd left us to die.{4:39\i1}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.26,0:07:18.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}He has all the food and her BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.92,0:07:22.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe he... left her with me,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.62,0:07:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}while he made off with our supplies!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.28,0:07:30.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have I been abandoned?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.94,0:07:34.47,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.26,0:07:39.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.54,0:07:42.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.56,0:07:45.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,Screw you, you old bastard!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,C-Crap!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.76,0:08:01.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.60,0:08:05.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}That BIM...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.38,0:08:17.61,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.00,0:08:20.09,Default,T,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.09,0:08:22.19,Default,T,0,0,0,,I've been looking everywhere for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}He didn't run away?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.94,0:08:30.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}We were both looking for each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.72,0:08:34.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our radars just canceled each other out?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.86,0:08:43.17,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, I... I doubted you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.74,0:08:44.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.34,0:08:49.99,Default,T,0,0,0,,When you're scared, all you can think of is the worst.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.74,0:08:52.84,Default,T,0,0,0,,I'm no different.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.32,0:08:56.53,Default,T,0,0,0,,So never give up hope!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.53,0:08:57.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,Right?
