Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.42,0:09:07.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,But are you sure about this, Mr. Taira?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.06,0:09:10.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,Weren't you intending to keep your BIM type secret?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.08,0:09:13.73,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.73,0:09:17.12,Default,T,0,0,0,,I still didn't trust you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.56,0:09:21.12,Default,T,0,0,0,,I didn't want to make enemies or let anyone get close.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.66,0:09:23.95,Default,T,0,0,0,,That's how I've lived.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.80,0:09:29.72,Default,T,0,0,0,,But you risked your life for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.72,0:09:31.53,Default,T,0,0,0,,You believed in me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.53,0:09:33.13,Default,T,0,0,0,,I was so happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.66,0:09:38.87,Default,T,0,0,0,,"If I stay with this person, I'll be saved. So I have to trust him completely."
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.26,Default,T,0,0,0,,That's all it was.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.80,0:09:50.27,Default,T,0,0,0,,The sea breeze!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.27,0:09:51.91,Default,T,0,0,0,,We're close to the sea.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.72,0:09:53.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.46,0:09:55.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.92,0:09:57.29,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.03,0:10:02.01,Default,T,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.28,0:10:09.17,Default,T,0,0,0,,We've gotta climb this thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.17,0:10:10.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,But what about her?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.64,0:10:14.13,Default,T,0,0,0,,We'll have to get her up there together.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.13,0:10:15.17,Default,T,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.36,0:10:21.67,Default,T,0,0,0,,Right, that's it...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.94,0:10:24.16,Default,T,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.16,0:10:25.14,Default,T,0,0,0,,You can do it!{I couldn't help but laugh when they bounced off his stomach :D}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.28,0:10:38.07,Default,T,0,0,0,,I'll buy you time.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.07,0:10:40.83,Default,T,0,0,0,,You get up there with the girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.64,0:10:45.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't do it alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.45,0:10:47.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}That ladder's all rusted.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.76,0:10:50.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}And his BIMs are a homing type.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.56,0:10:53.80,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}They'll lock on...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.80,0:10:56.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}then home in.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}But they aren't powerful at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.14,0:11:06.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.90,Default,S,0,0,0,,Climb up there on your own!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.90,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.94,0:11:15.90,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.94,0:11:18.52,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Karma...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this my punishment?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.22,0:11:24.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we sacrifice her, we can survive.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.64,0:11:27.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.57,0:11:29.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't do something so cruel.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.60,0:11:32.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,You want me...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.52,0:11:37.46,Default,S,0,0,0,,You want me to become a monster? { More of a You're telling me to... thing, but meh }
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.92,0:11:49.95,Default,T,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.95,0:11:51.73,Default,T,0,0,0,,This won't hold them off!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.79,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, are you up there yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.42,0:12:03.03,Default,T,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.00,0:12:05.65,Default,T,0,0,0,,Is he insane?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.82,0:12:10.54,Default,T,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's gonna sacrifice her so he alone can survive?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.43,Default,T,0,0,0,,I've lost faith in you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.43,0:12:14.91,Default,T,0,0,0,,I've lost faith in you, Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.25,Default,T,0,0,0,,What's that smoke?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.22,0:12:31.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,Get back, Mr. Taira.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.36,0:12:35.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's one of the corrosive gas type BIMs she has.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's very hazardous.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.38,0:12:40.93,Default,T,0,0,0,,Her BIMs?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.92,0:12:46.37,Default,T,0,0,0,,Back there, you said you could only use your own.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.36,0:12:50.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yes, but I just had an idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.31,0:12:52.12,Default,S,0,0,0,,I found another way.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.48,0:12:54.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,I {\i1}made{\i0} her push the switch.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.69,Default,T,0,0,0,,Didn't know you could do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.26,0:13:03.03,Default,T,0,0,0,,But the gas is spreading.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.39,Default,T,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.17,Default,S,0,0,0,,It'll be fine...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.17,0:13:08.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,as long as we're here.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.82,0:13:11.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,Here, where the sea breeze is blowing.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.74,0:13:13.73,Default,T,0,0,0,,The sea breeze?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.73,0:13:16.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,The sea breeze blows in here, \Nand we're surrounded by rocks.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.66,0:13:22.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,Places like this are where the \Ncorrosive gas type are most effective.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.41,Default,T,0,0,0,,A-Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.41,0:13:27.70,Default,T,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.40,0:13:30.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,This game is different from{\i0\i1} BTOOOM!{\i1}.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.09,0:13:35.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,In{\i0\i1} BTOOOM!, {\i1}there isn't any wind,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.98,0:13:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and you can't take and use someone else's BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.74,0:13:46.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,This is the real life {\i0\i1}BTOOOM!{\i1}.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.23,0:14:00.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,Seems a BIM killed someone here.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.99,0:14:03.78,Default,S,0,0,0,,It isn't recent.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.36,0:14:09.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,There might have been a game like this before we arrived.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.27,Default,T,0,0,0,,Tired...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.27,0:14:19.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.24,0:14:24.45,Default,T,0,0,0,,Well, if we've come this far, we should be safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.45,0:14:28.55,Default,T,0,0,0,,You know, when you climbed up that ladder alone,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.86,0:14:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I started to wonder what you were thinking.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.28,0:14:36.18,Default,T,0,0,0,,M-Maybe it's because I can finally relax...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.58,0:14:38.77,Default,T,0,0,0,,but I feel really dizzy.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.94,0:14:41.17,Default,T,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.17,0:14:44.55,Default,T,0,0,0,,O-Ow! Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.60,0:14:48.95,Default,T,0,0,0,,The leg that was bitten just started hurting.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.48,0:14:54.11,Default,S,0,0,0,,He has a really bad fever!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.09,0:15:05.86,Default,H,0,0,0,,Are the lizards gone?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.86,0:15:07.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,Five of them are dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.60,0:15:09.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'd bet the rest returned to the forest.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.77,0:15:13.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,And it still smells like poison around here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.22,0:15:15.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,I doubt they'll be back.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.12,Default,H,0,0,0,,Hey. What do you think you're looking at?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.47,0:15:27.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.56,0:15:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't looking.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.85,0:15:31.30,Default,H,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.91,0:15:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't do anything weird \Nwhile I was out, did you?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.78,0:15:37.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,Weird?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.35,0:15:45.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,S-Scum!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.62,0:15:46.56,Default,H,0,0,0,,You pervert!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.26,0:15:49.12,Default,S,0,0,0,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.12,0:15:50.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.54,0:15:51.14,Default,H,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.14,0:15:52.56,Default,H,0,0,0,,It's written all over your face!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.56,0:15:54.28,Default,H,0,0,0,,Stay away from me, asshole.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.28,0:15:55.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't jump to conclusions!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.57,0:16:03.86,Default,H,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.77,0:16:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.92,0:16:20.30,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.13,0:16:22.62,Default,T,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.19,0:16:29.54,Default,H,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.54,0:16:31.31,Default,H,0,0,0,,Help me out here!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.07,0:16:34.19,Default,H,0,0,0,,We need to disinfect it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.65,0:16:37.22,Default,H,0,0,0,,Help me hold him down.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.07,Default,H,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.07,0:16:43.19,Default,H,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.45,0:16:50.36,Default,H,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.36,0:16:53.20,Default,H,0,0,0,,I don't want to touch a man!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.20,0:16:55.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.10,0:16:57.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,This isn't the time for that!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.79,0:17:00.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,He got bitten trying to protect {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.71,0:17:03.84,Default,S,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.11,0:17:11.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.39,0:17:26.80,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}What'll happen... to us...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.19,0:17:29.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}from now on?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.87,0:17:37.90,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Hey, there!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.13,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.47,0:17:41.61,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Thanks for the all-nighter!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.61,0:17:43.13,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Here, some snacks.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.61,0:17:45.24,Default,O,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.24,0:17:46.14,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.14,0:17:48.16,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Anything neat happen?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.16,0:17:51.89,Default,O,0,0,0,,Nothing notable at the moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.39,0:17:53.58,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.58,0:17:56.26,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Looks like Sakamoto is still alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.26,0:17:56.89,Default,O,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.37,0:18:00.22,Default,O,0,0,0,,He's already made contact with four other players,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.22,0:18:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but he only killed the first one.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.92,0:18:05.65,Default,O,0,0,0,,It appears he's gathering allies.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.23,0:18:07.54,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.54,0:18:09.56,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,That sounds like him.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.56,0:18:12.10,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,He'll give us some good data.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.10,0:18:14.44,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Make sure you collect it all.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.44,0:18:15.79,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.33,0:18:17.04,Default,O,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:27.55,B-TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(941.501,249.501)\fnMarkerScript\bord3.75\alpha&32&\blur1.05\b1\fs132\fsp6\frz8.749\frx2\fry0\c&HEABFC9&\3c&HEABFC9&}Our First Cosplay
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.30,0:18:27.55,B-TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(941.501,249.501)\fnMarkerScript\blur1.05\alpha&64&\b1\fs132\fsp6\frz8.749\frx2\fry0\c&HCABADF&\1a&H00&}Our Firs{\c&HD8ADC5&}t Cosplay
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.55,0:18:32.30,B-TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(736,240.501)\fnMarkerScript\blur1.05\alpha&7D&\b1\fs25.5\frx2\fry0\c&HBE98CA&\frz21.24}Our First Cosplay
Dialogue: 2,0:18:27.55,0:18:32.30,B-TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(736,240.501)\fnMarkerScript\blur3.75\alpha&7D&\b1\fs25.5\frx2\fry0\c&HBE98CA&\frz21.24}Our First Cosplay
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.09,0:18:31.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,You won't get cell reception out here.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.25,0:18:36.81,Default,H,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.81,0:18:38.56,Default,H,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.43,0:18:41.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that we're working together,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know your name yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.01,0:18:48.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,Was that picture taken in a photo booth?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.79,0:18:50.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,So you cosplay.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.29,0:18:53.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,Is that character...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.49,0:18:56.94,Default,H,0,0,0,,Don't look at my cell phone!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.79,0:18:58.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,You sicko.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.63,0:19:02.24,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.24,0:19:04.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,That's my line, you ass.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.99,0:19:09.01,Default,H,0,0,0,,And I'm {\i1}not{\i0} "working with you two".
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.35,0:19:14.01,Default,H,0,0,0,,I don't trust men, so there's no point telling you my name!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.19,0:19:17.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,Whether you're working with us or not,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.23,0:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you this:
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.65,0:19:24.52,Default,S,0,0,0,,All those BIMs and that food you have...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.25,0:19:27.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,how did you get them?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.33,0:19:35.07,Default,S,0,0,0,,You didn't just have the trunk, you had crackers and timers,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.07,0:19:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and corrosive gas types, as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.95,0:19:40.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,You can only use your own BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.50,0:19:43.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,To use another player's BIMs, you can't just steal them.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.82,0:19:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to kill the enemy player before they'll belong to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.85,0:19:51.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,How many have you killed?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.65,0:19:56.78,Default,T,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, are you saying she's a murderer?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.78,0:19:57.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.17,0:20:00.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,We need to know what she's thinking,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.37,0:20:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,or she could turn on us at any moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.91,0:20:12.36,Default,H,0,0,0,,Why do I have to tell you that?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.31,0:20:15.34,Default,H,0,0,0,,It was to protect myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.34,0:20:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice!{split}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.05,0:20:19.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'd have been...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.43,0:20:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have been...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.03,0:20:27.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she saying it was self-defense?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.83,0:20:30.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or could this all be an act?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.77,0:20:35.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,It might be a bit harsh, but you're\Nunder a lot of suspicion right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.51,0:20:40.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,Unless you answer me, I can't take my guard down around you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.37,0:20:44.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,All it takes is one hit from behind, and it's over.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.31,0:20:45.98,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you were to kill us...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.90,0:20:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you could get the eight chips\Nyou need to escape this island.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.37,0:20:55.91,Default,H,0,0,0,,I would never...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.27,0:20:57.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sonar!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.01,0:20:59.66,Default,T,0,0,0,,Is someone here?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.39,0:21:01.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.77,0:21:03.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's still far away.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.47,0:21:07.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,No one was seen, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.57,0:21:14.05,Default,H,0,0,0,,Th-They found me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.45,0:21:19.12,Default,H,0,0,0,,I-I'll...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.27,0:21:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave this place.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.68,0:21:22.93,Default,T,0,0,0,,W-Wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.67,0:21:27.44,Default,H,0,0,0,,But if I stay, that guy's gonna come here, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.26,0:21:31.04,Default,H,0,0,0,,The killing will start again.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.49,0:21:35.34,Default,H,0,0,0,,You should hide, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.34,0:21:37.48,Default,T,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.30,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.42,0:21:42.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,They only found one person.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.51,0:21:46.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll act as a decoy and draw them off.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.69,0:21:49.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,When I get back, we'll settle this.
