Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.27,0:23:27.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,Geez, what the hell am I doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.81,0:23:32.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,When I played the game online,\NI used to enjoy helping others like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.15,0:23:35.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,But this time, I'm risking my life.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.01,0:23:43.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time to get rid of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:44.19,0:23:48.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll run to the other side, and I should appear to be getting farther away.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.99,0:23:55.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}If they're farther away in my next scan, we won't have to fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.61,0:24:11.18,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,I head into enemy territory to \Nrecover a kidnapped girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.97,0:24:13.93,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,Is there a reason to risk my life?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.97,0:24:17.81,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,I saw it.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.81,0:24:19.06,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.06,0:24:21.74,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,she's my...
